OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright day with variable,
OL,6,Foften large, amounts of cloud but also
OL,7,Fsome sunny spells. Patchy drizzle is
OL,8,Fpossible at times. Occasionally
OL,9,Fmoderate southeasterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FContinuing rather cloudy,
OL,12,Fwith only limited clearer spells, and
OL,13,Fa little drizzle at times. Mainly
OL,14,Flight easterly or southeasterly winds.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSaturday:FA brighter day with some
OL,17,Fsunny spells, but still quite a lot of
OL,18,Fcloud at times with a few spots of
OL,19,Fdrizzle around. Mainly light southerly
OL,20,For southeasterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
