OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FRather
OL,6,Fcloudy into next week with only
OL,7,Flimited sunny or clear spells and the
OL,8,Frisk of patchy drizzle or showers.
OL,9,FLight winds Sunday and Monday but a
OL,10,Ffreshening southwesterly Tuesday.
